                                "sense_id": "6912746e-10d6-3c7b-9462-d1982ec33e6a",
                                "text": "There was a desolate village in a wood,\nWhose bloom-inwoven leaves now scattering fed\nThe hungry storm; it was a place of blood,\nA heap of hearthless walls;—the flames were dead\nWithin those dwellings now,—the life had fled\nFrom all those corpses now,— […]"
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "c37ab596-7196-423a-8551-a4b3cd25cfff",
                                "sense_id": "6912746e-10d6-3c7b-9462-d1982ec33e6a",
                                "text": "For this reason, a hearthless pusher-type furnace has been developed."
                            }
                        ]
